    "description": "Looking for a fun way to make money from your phone? Try out PlayTime Cash! \r\n\r\nPlayTime Cash rewards you for your time playing games. You get cash rewards for each minute of your gameplay. PlayTime Cash also brings you the best and top trending games, so you can have fun while making money from your phone.  \r\n\r\nMake sure to accept our permissions to get the most rewards! Without permissions, you may only get paid per level or task. But by accepting our permissions, you will get paid per minute of your time, regardless of the difficulty of the game, level or task. \r\n\r\nStop wasting time playing games and not getting paid. Download PlayTime Cash, and you can earn $5 in 10-20 minutes. Keep playing, and you'll get paid even more for being a loyal user! \r\n\r\nDownload PlayTime Cash now, and start collecting your cash rewards!",
